
<details class="mb-3">
  <summary class="text-primary" style="cursor: pointer;">
    Markdown Guide — How to format your description?
  </summary>

  <div class="card card-body mt-2">
    <p><code># Heading</code> → Large heading</p>
    <p><code>## Heading</code> → Smaller heading</p>
    <p><code>**text**</code> → <strong>Bold text</strong></p>
    <p><code>*text*</code> → <em>Italic text</em></p>
    <p><code>- Item</code> → Bullet list</p>
    <p><code>[Google](https://google.com)</code> → Link</p>
    <p class="mb-0"><code>`code`</code> → <code>code</code></p>
  </div>
</details>
